    <h1>Trying AI in real work.<br />Documenting what happens.</h1>
    <p>Experiments with documents and recurring tasks: what was tried, what worked, and what still needs attention.</p>
    <div class="links"><a href="/work/">Explore the work →</a><a href="/about/">About this project</a></div>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="work-title">
    <h2 id="work-title">Public projects</h2>
