      <p class="eyebrow">Skills for AI desktop apps</p>
      <h3><a href="/work/dropkits/">dropkits</a></h3>
      <p>Small skills for ChatGPT, Claude, and Codex. The model fills in the content; a short Python script makes the exact file: spreadsheets, business cards, timelines, decision matrices, and quotes.</p>
      <div class="links"><a href="/work/dropkits/">Project overview →</a><a href="https://github.com/Hskim-droid/dropkits/releases/latest">Download the kits</a></div>
    </article>
  </section>
  <section class="section"><h2>Reading archive</h2><p>Notes collected from external sources, with links to the original material.</p><a href="/reading/">Browse the archive →</a></section>
